  kicker="The fourth axis"
  description="Beyond pigment, cortisol, and appetite, the melanocortin system has a fourth job — calming inflammation. It runs mainly through MC1R and MC3R on immune cells, works without acting as a steroid, and is now the target of a growing pipeline from ulcerative colitis to dry eye."
